# The PII detector image's build context: an allowlist. Everything in the
# checkout is left out, and only what the Dockerfile COPYs is let back in.
# BuildKit reads this file in place of the root `.dockerignore` because it sits
# beside the Dockerfile with the Dockerfile's name. The root file excludes
# `tests/`, which held back the committed fixture corpus the test stage reads,
# so the test stage could not be built from it.
# tests/unit/presidio-image-context.test.ts holds this list to the COPY lines.
*
!guards/presidio/requirements.txt
!guards/presidio/requirements-test.txt
!guards/presidio/inflect_pii
!guards/presidio/tests
!tests/fixtures/pii/corpus.json
!tests/fixtures/pii/corpus.sha256
